  "body": "- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Agreed on https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7923, and no need to change the implementations.\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-script-element/script-type-and-language-js.html\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Not needed, this PR changes the spec to align with all three browser implementations.\n\nFixes https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7923.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8084/scripting.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 6, 2022, 9:07 PM UTC (c4484cc)\">/scripting.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8084/5ddb6b4...c4484cc/scripting.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 6, 2022, 9:07 PM UTC (c4484cc)\">diff</a> )",
